# kit/pi/item-detail/whole 70x60 @2,2 (66x16)
wrong · seen 3× · 2 days ago
pi's permission gate cannot resolve shell variables, so cat
$S/id_ed25519 reads what cat ~/.ssh/id_ed25519 denies.

Why the repo didn't say it
The docs describe the gate as matching on the command text, and
nothing says the text is not expanded first.

Details
Measured: the path projection resolves only HOME and PWD.
Any other $VAR spelling lands inside cwd and is allowed.

Points at
path     modules/programs/pi/default.nix
command  cat $S/id_ed25519
quote    “if it happens again, just wait”
